<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #0B1220 0%, #16233D 100%)', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>
    {/* A 区 · 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, background: '#2AD4EE', marginTop: 5 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9' }}>方案 B：原生 Function Calling（推荐）</Text>
            <Text style={{ marginTop: 8, fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.52)' }}>工具用 JSON Schema 声明，模型直接返回结构化参数——不用正则</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 516, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 36 }}>
            {/* 左：要点栏 */}
            <Box style={{ width: 336, flexDirection: 'column', paddingRight: 28, borderRight: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.12)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>WHY BETTER</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 16, fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    格式是官方标准，
                    <br />
                    不用自己发明
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 18, fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.70)', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
                    工具用 JSON Schema 正式声明并随请求传入；模型开启特训过的「工具模式」，返回值直接是结构化 JSON，稳定性和兼容性都由模型侧保证。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginTop: 18, flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>
                    {['JSON Schema', 'tool_calls', '无需正则'].map((k, i) => (
                        <Box key={i} style={{ paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, paddingLeft: 10, paddingRight: 10, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.10)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE' }}>{k}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, paddingLeft: 16, paddingRight: 16, background: 'rgba(22,35,61,0.95)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.35)', borderLeft: '3px solid #2AD4EE', borderRadius: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF9', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
                        description 就是写给模型看的 API 文档——模型选错工具，90% 是这里写得烂。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 右：代码 */}
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>fc_demo_b.js</Text>
                    <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 14, background: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.22)' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.62)' }}>声明 → 调用 → 回填，三步走完</Text>
                </Box>
                <CodeBlock
                    code={`// ① 用 JSON Schema 声明工具（name / description / parameters）
const tools = [{ type: "function", function: {
  name: "calculate",
  description: "计算数学表达式的值，如加减乘除",
  parameters: { type: "object", required: ["expression"],
    properties: { expression: { type: "string",
      description: "数学表达式，如 128*456" } } },
}}];
// ② tools 随请求传入；模型返回结构化 tool_calls
const msg = await llm(messages, tools);
for (const tc of msg.tool_calls) {
  const args = JSON.parse(tc.function.arguments);      // 参数直接是 JSON
  const r = TOOLS[tc.function.name](...Object.values(args));
  messages.push({ role: "tool", tool_call_id: tc.id, content: String(r) });
}`}
                    language='javascript'
                    width={764}
                    fontSize={12}
                    theme='github-dark'
                />
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 底部通栏 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 46, marginTop: 10, flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 16, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.22)', borderRadius: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#2AD4EE', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>结论</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 28, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.35)' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E8EEF9', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                实际项目一律用原生 Function Calling；手写 Prompt 只用来理解原理——模型自动把「128 乘以 456」翻译成了表达式，靠的就是 description。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 · 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)' }}>从 LLM 到 Agent 再到 Pi Agent</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>08 / 33</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
